### 2. Temporal Fusion Transformer (TFT) Section

**Lines 572-987** (~410 lines): Added comprehensive section on TFT, the state-of-the-art deep learning model for time series forecasting.

**Key subsections:**

#### Production TFT Implementation
- Architecture details (Variable Selection Networks, LSTM Encoder/Decoder, Attention mechanisms)
- Data preparation with feature categorization (static, time-varying known, time-varying unknown)
- Model creation with PyTorch Forecasting
- Training with PyTorch Lightning
- Prediction with attention weight extraction
- Variable importance analysis

#### Mock TFT Implementation
- Educational demonstration version
- Simulates TFT behavior without training
- Generates realistic forecasts with attention weights
- Used for frontend visualizations

#### Design Decisions
- Comparison table: TFT vs ARIMA/GARCH
- Explanation of attention mechanisms
- Quantile loss for uncertainty quantification
- Feature categorization rationale
- PyTorch Lightning benefits
- Mock TFT use cases

**Code examples included:**
- Complete TFT class structure
- Data preparation pipeline
- Training loop
- Prediction with attention
- Quantile generation
- Attention weight simulation
- Model comparison logic

